  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Strengthen Competitiveness and Improve the Sustainability, Inclusivity and Resilience of the Panamanian Tourism Sector</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para Impulsar la Competitividad y Mejorar la Sostenibilidad, Inclusividad y Resiliencia del Sector Turstico Panameo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la serie programtica es promover el crecimiento econmico sostenible e inclusivo de Panam, a travs de mejorar la competitividad del sector turstico panameo. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) mejorar el acceso a datos y anlisis tursticos para contribuir a informar el diseo de las polticas pblicas y la inversin sectorial;; (ii) fortalecer la diversificacin de los productos tursticos de Panam; y (iii) reforzar la sostenibilidad, resiliencia, inclusividad por etnicidad y la igualdad de gnero del sector turstico de Panam</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote the sustainable and inclusive economic growth of Panama through improving the competitiveness, sustainability and resilience of the Panamanian tourism sector. The specific objectives are: (i) to improve the access to the tourism sector data and analysis to contribute to inform the design of public policies and the tourism sector investment; (ii) strengthen the diversification of Panamanian tourism products; and (iii) strengthen the sustainability, resilience, inclusiveness for ethnicity and gender equality of the Panamanian tourism sector.</narrative>
  </description>
